      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Isolation is the database's job",
      "items": [
        "Neo4j is asked for exactly the groups this caller may read — never fetch-everything-then-filter",
        "Group ids carry the organisation: two companies tracking the same git remote never share a group"
      ]
